{
    "title": "GPS Speedometer & Odometer",
    "description": "Get the advanced real-time speed tracking with GPS Speedometer and Odometer! Measure speed, distance and current location offline for all transportation. Whether you\u2019re riding a car, motorcycle, bike or any other vehicle, you'll always know how fast you\u2019re going. When you go over the speed limit, the GPS speedometer will sound an alarm to keep you safe. The built-in GPS tracker keeps track of your route and direction, in different travel modes like driving or jogging. \r\n\r\nWhat's more, we've got three display modes (digital, gauge, and map view) for you to choose, showing your speed fast and accurately. Specially designed digital HUD mode will show your current car's speed right on the windshield. Easily switch between miles per hour (mph), kilometers per hour (kph), and knots, displaying your vehicle's velocity in various scales.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features</b>: \r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude97 <b>Accurate Speed Tracking</b>: Measure your real-time speed, average speed, and maximum speed with high precision.\r\n\ud83c\udf10 <b>Offline Speedometer</b>: No need for an internet connection, our app can work offline whenever you need it. \r\n\ud83e\ude9e <b>Head-Up Display (HUD) Mode</b>: Stay focused on the road by viewing current speed on your car's windshield.\r\n\ud83d\udcf1<b>User-friendly Interface</b>: Simple and easy-to-use UI to check speed and distance at a glance.\r\n\ud83e\udded <b>GPS Navigation</b>: The GPS tracker will help you find your way effortlessly, and map out your starting and ending points\r\n\ud83d\ude80 <b>Digital Speed Tracker</b>: Whether driving, cycling, jogging, or engaging in any activity, our GPS Speedometer and Odometer has you covered!\r\n\u26a0\ufe0f <b>Speed Limit Alerts</b>: Stay safe with overspeed warnings through alarms and vibration.\r\n\ud83d\udd04 <b>Three Units Switching</b>: Display your speed in your preferred units, choose from kilometers per hour(km/h), miles per hour(mph), and knots.\r\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <b>Detailed Route Tracker</b>: Mark and save your routes for easy access, and turn off the tracker whenever you want.\r\n\ud83d\udccc <b>Speed Notification</b>: Stay informed about your speed and control tracking in the notification bar.\r\n\ud83d\udd03 <b>Portrait and Landscape Modes</b>: Conveniently switch between portrait and landscape modes for the view.\r\n\ud83d\udd0b <b>Battery saver</b>: Compact in size, track your speed and distance just draining little power.\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Personalized Themes</b>: Make your own speedometer with various theme colors to match your style.\r\n\ud83d\uddbc <b>Window Modes</b>: Pop up the speedometer as a small window over other apps, perfect for when you're using navigation.\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for an easy-to-use speedometer, then this app is your top choice! The attractive GPS Speedometer and Odometer display will give you a real feel just like a real car speedometer. So get this speedometer now and enjoy the trip!\r\n\r\n<b>What Can GPS Speedometer & Odometer Track?</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Speed</b>: Real-time speed, maximum speed, and average speed.\r\n<b>Distance</b>: Record your travel distance for various activities.\r\n<b>Location</b>: Know your accurate location with the GPS tracker\r\n<b>Route</b>: Draw and save your travel route with ease.\r\n<b>Time</b>: Track the duration of your trips.\r\n\r\nUse our app for as many activities as you want, perfect for driving, cycling, jogging, and more!\r\n\r\nDiscover the powerful GPS Speedometer & Odometer with accurate speed measurement, speed limit, and distance tracker. No internet required! This is your reliable partner for tracking average speed & maximum speed and ensuring safety. Perfect for cycling, driving, running, walking, flying, sailing, or any transportation! Download and explore on the go!",
