knots.<br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <b>Detailed Route Tracker</b>: Mark and save your routes for easy access, and turn off the tracker whenever you want.<br>\ud83d\udccc <b>Speed Notification</b>: Stay informed about your speed and control tracking in the notification bar.<br>\ud83d\udd03 <b>Portrait and Landscape Modes</b>: Conveniently switch between portrait and landscape modes for the view.<br>\ud83d\udd0b <b>Battery saver</b>: Compact in size, track your speed and distance just draining little power.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Personalized Themes</b>: Make your own speedometer with various theme colors to match your style.<br>\ud83d\uddbc <b>Window Modes</b>: Pop up the speedometer as a small window over other apps, perfect for when you&#39;re using navigation.<br><br>If you&#39;re looking for an easy-to-use speedometer, then this app is your top choice! The attractive GPS Speedometer and Odometer display will give you a real feel just like a real car speedometer. So get this speedometer now and enjoy the trip!<br><br><b>What Can GPS Speedometer &amp; Odometer Track?</b><br><br><b>Speed</b>: Real-time speed, maximum speed, and average speed.<br><b>Distance</b>: Record your travel distance for various activities.<br><b>Location</b>: Know your accurate location with the GPS tracker<br><b>Route</b>: Draw and save your travel route with ease.<br><b>Time</b>: Track the duration of your trips.<br><br>Use our app for as many activities as you want, perfect for driving, cycling, jogging, and more!<br><br>Discover the powerful GPS Speedometer &amp; Odometer with accurate speed measurement, speed limit, and distance tracker. No internet required! This is your reliable partner for tracking average speed &amp; maximum speed and ensuring safety. Perfect for cycling, driving, running, walking, flying, sailing, or any transportation! Download and explore on the go!",
